              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum, nen, i ceng’ maeca, man i nindo maeca, kan abidwoko ng’eca mi Yuda man Yerusalem ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abicoko thek ceke, man abikelogi piny i poga pa Yehocafat; man abipoko lembe i wigi keca pi dhanu para man pi camupacu para Israel, ma gilalu i kind thek; man gipoko ng’om para, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e gigoyo jara pi dhanu para, man gimio nyathin ma nico pi won asara, giloko nyathin ma nyaku de ku pigulok, kara gimadhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
