          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wurwei lembe maeni i kind thek; wuyik ali; wuthub dhanu ma jutego; wek dhanu ceke mir ali gicor ceng’ni, wek giidh malu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 4:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wucany kwer mu ni palamularu, man uligu ni tong’: wek ju ma ng’ic giwac kumae, An a tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutim pio, man wubin, wu thek ceke m’utieko piny gbur, man wucokru giwu karacelo: keth dhanu peri ma tek gilor piny keca, E Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wek thek giyauri gigi, man giidh ba poga Yehocafat; kum abijany keca nipoko lembe wi thek ceke m’utieko piny gbur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
